        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farmer’s Market, a cozy low-poly farming simulator where country life comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, nurture, and harvest your own crops, then take your fresh produce to the market to sell, earn coins, and unlock new seeds, tools, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farm at your own pace: expand your land, decorate your surroundings, and experiment with different crop combinations to maximize your profits. With its colorful low-poly style and relaxing atmosphere, it’s perfect for fans of farming, simulation games, and the slow life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the most successful farmer in the region?</p>",
